flowchart TB
  Internet --> CF[Cloudflare DNS/WAF/CDN/Turnstile]
  CF --> GLB[GCP External HTTPS LB]
  GLB --> API[Cloud Run api]
  GLB --> RT[Cloud Run realtime]
  API --> VPC[Private VPC connectivity]
  RT --> VPC
  VPC --> SQL[(Cloud SQL PostgreSQL/PostGIS HA)]
  VPC --> VAL[(Memorystore Valkey HA)]
  API --> PUB[Pub/Sub]
  API --> TASKS[Cloud Tasks]
  PUB --> WORK[Cloud Run workers]
  TASKS --> WORK
  WORK --> SQL
  WORK --> VAL
  API --> GCS[Cloud Storage]
  WORK --> GCS
  API --> SM[Secret Manager/KMS]
  WORK --> SM
  API --> BQ[BigQuery]
